The following uses or conditions shall be and are hereby prohibited within wellhead protection zones, whether or not such use or condition may otherwise be ordinarily included as a part of a use permitted under section 14-106:
(1) Surface use or storage of hazardous material, expressly including commercial use of agricultural pesticides;
